WEBVTT

01:01:29.355 --> 01:01:33.776
So a whole new set
of outsourcing will happen.

01:01:33.800 --> 01:01:39.874
Going away from the supply chain,
manufacturing and IT outsourcing,

01:01:39.898 --> 01:01:44.104
moving into this service outsourcing.

01:01:44.128 --> 01:01:49.323
And those are the types of solutions
countries have to look at.

01:01:49.347 --> 01:01:51.880
I think it's not realistic
for every country

01:01:51.904 --> 01:01:54.783
to say, "We're going to compete
with China and US

01:01:54.807 --> 01:01:56.537
and become the third giant."

01:01:56.561 --> 01:01:58.561
I've heard so many countries say that,

01:01:58.585 --> 01:02:00.145
but it's really not realistic.